---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/';
const target = `${base.endsWith('/') ? base : `${base}/`}xizong/circulation/b01/`;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0;url=${target}`} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={target} />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Redirecting to Current Xizong B1</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>此旧入口已收敛到当前西综 Runtime。<a href={target}>继续到 B1 · 正常机械循环</a></p>
    <script define:vars={{ target }}>
      window.location.replace(target);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
